# The nightly retention run. Scheduling this is not optional housekeeping: an
# installation where cleanup never runs keeps every order forever, which breaks
# the retention period promised in the privacy notice (docs/13).
#
# Safe while the server is running and safe to run twice.
17 3 * * *  doenerstag  /usr/bin/doenerstag cleanup -c /etc/doenerstag/doenerstag.yaml
